# The log of the test must have a line for each of these patterns (grep -E).
# The player drops onto the head of a soldier. The soldier is an ally, so it gets no stomp damage.
\[4\.70\].* JCDentonMale0 .* Base=None Physics=PHYS_Falling
# The script of the soldier pushes the player off, and the player comes to the ground next to it.
\[7\.00\].* JCDentonMale0 .* loc=\(-4804 10435 -260\) .* Base=LevelInfo'LevelInfo0' Physics=PHYS_Walking
\[7\.10\].* UNATCOTroop0 .* Health=100
# The player drops onto a burning barrel. The barrel is the base, and its fire takes health.
\[11\.00\].* JCDentonMale0 .* health=99 Base=BarrelFire'BarrelFire0' Physics=PHYS_Walking
# A fall of 660 units hurts the legs and the torso.
\[15\.00\].* JCDentonMale0 .* loc=\(-4761 10431 -260\) .* health=70 Base=LevelInfo'LevelInfo0' HealthLegLeft=0 HealthLegRight=61 HealthTorso=50
!Accessed None
